{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type SystemPrompt<TMetadata> = \n  | string\n  | {\n  content: string;\n  metadata?: TMetadata;\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/system-prompts.ts#L39","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/system-prompts.ts:39"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A single entry in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat({ systemPrompts: [...] })"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Accepts a plain string (the common case) or a structured object that lets\nproviders attach typed metadata to the prompt — e.g. Anthropic\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cache_control"},{"type":"text","value":" for prompt caching, future per-prompt safety overrides for\nGemini, etc."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"At the chat call site, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"metadata"},{"type":"text","value":" is narrowed by the adapter via\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"~types['systemPromptMetadata']"},{"type":"text","value":". Providers that don't declare one inherit\nthe default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"},{"type":"text","value":", which makes the field carry no meaningful value: TS\nonly accepts "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" there, and provider-foreign metadata that reaches\nan adapter via JS / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"as any"},{"type":"text","value":" is silently dropped, never written to the\nwire. For type-safe per-provider metadata, refer to the provider's\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<Provider>SystemPromptMetadata"},{"type":"text","value":" interface (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnthropicSystemPromptMetadata"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tmetadata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TMetadata"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TMetadata"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// The 90% case — plain strings work everywhere.\n  systemPrompts: ['Be concise.', 'Cite sources.']","lang":"ts"},{"type":"code","value":"// Provider-specific metadata via the object form. No `satisfies` cast\n  // is needed — the adapter narrows the `metadata` field's type at the\n  // call site so users get autocomplete and structural checking\n  // automatically.\n  import { anthropicText } from '@tanstack/ai-anthropic'\n\n  chat({\n    adapter: anthropicText(),\n    systemPrompts: [\n      {\n        content: 'Stable instructions — cache me.',\n        metadata: { cache_control: { type: 'ephemeral' } },\n      },\n      'Volatile per-request instruction.',\n    ],\n  })","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tmetadata","text":"TMetadata","level":3},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype SystemPrompt<TMetadata> = \n  | string\n  | {\n  content: string;\n  metadata?: TMetadata;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/system-prompts.ts:39](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/system-prompts.ts#L39)\n\nA single entry in `chat({ systemPrompts: [...] })`.\n\nAccepts a plain string (the common case) or a structured object that lets\nproviders attach typed metadata to the prompt — e.g. Anthropic\n`cache_control` for prompt caching, future per-prompt safety overrides for\nGemini, etc.\n\nAt the chat call site, `metadata` is narrowed by the adapter via\n`~types['systemPromptMetadata']`. Providers that don't declare one inherit\nthe default `never`, which makes the field carry no meaningful value: TS\nonly accepts `undefined` there, and provider-foreign metadata that reaches\nan adapter via JS / `as any` is silently dropped, never written to the\nwire. For type-safe per-provider metadata, refer to the provider's\n`<Provider>SystemPromptMetadata` interface (e.g. `AnthropicSystemPromptMetadata`).\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TMetadata\n\n`TMetadata` = `unknown`\n\n## Examples\n\n```ts\n// The 90% case — plain strings work everywhere.\n  systemPrompts: ['Be concise.', 'Cite sources.']\n```\n\n```ts\n// Provider-specific metadata via the object form. No `satisfies` cast\n  // is needed — the adapter narrows the `metadata` field's type at the\n  // call site so users get autocomplete and structural checking\n  // automatically.\n  import { anthropicText } from '@tanstack/ai-anthropic'\n\n  chat({\n    adapter: anthropicText(),\n    systemPrompts: [\n      {\n        content: 'Stable instructions — cache me.',\n        metadata: { cache_control: { type: 'ephemeral' } },\n      },\n      'Volatile per-request instruction.',\n    ],\n  })\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SystemPrompt\ntitle: SystemPrompt\n---\n\n```ts\ntype SystemPrompt<TMetadata> = \n  | string\n  | {\n  content: string;\n  metadata?: TMetadata;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/system-prompts.ts:39](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/system-prompts.ts#L39)\n\nA single entry in `chat({ systemPrompts: [...] })`.\n\nAccepts a plain string (the common case) or a structured object that lets\nproviders attach typed metadata to the prompt — e.g. Anthropic\n`cache_control` for prompt caching, future per-prompt safety overrides for\nGemini, etc.\n\nAt the chat call site, `metadata` is narrowed by the adapter via\n`~types['systemPromptMetadata']`. Providers that don't declare one inherit\nthe default `never`, which makes the field carry no meaningful value: TS\nonly accepts `undefined` there, and provider-foreign metadata that reaches\nan adapter via JS / `as any` is silently dropped, never written to the\nwire. For type-safe per-provider metadata, refer to the provider's\n`<Provider>SystemPromptMetadata` interface (e.g. `AnthropicSystemPromptMetadata`).\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TMetadata\n\n`TMetadata` = `unknown`\n\n## Examples\n\n```ts\n// The 90% case — plain strings work everywhere.\n  systemPrompts: ['Be concise.', 'Cite sources.']\n```\n\n```ts\n// Provider-specific metadata via the object form. No `satisfies` cast\n  // is needed — the adapter narrows the `metadata` field's type at the\n  // call site so users get autocomplete and structural checking\n  // automatically.\n  import { anthropicText } from '@tanstack/ai-anthropic'\n\n  chat({\n    adapter: anthropicText(),\n    systemPrompts: [\n      {\n        content: 'Stable instructions — cache me.',\n        metadata: { cache_control: { type: 'ephemeral' } },\n      },\n      'Volatile per-request instruction.',\n    ],\n  })\n```\n"}
